<Project>

  <!-- 四个子项目共用的编译设置集中在这里，同一项不再在四处各写一遍
       语言版本集中在此尤其重要：它一旦写成 latest，就会随机器上最高的 SDK 浮动，
       同一份源码在不同机器上可能编译出不同结果
       TargetFramework 不放在这里，因为各项目并不相同（App 需要指定 Windows SDK 版本）

       Compiler settings shared by all four projects live here, so one value is not written out in four places
       Keeping the language version here matters especially: written as latest it would float with the highest
       SDK on the machine, so the same source may compile to different results on different machines
       TargetFramework is not here because the projects differ (App pins a Windows SDK version) -->

  <PropertyGroup>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>14</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

</Project>
